.TH CALCULATOR 1 "November 2026" "calculator 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
calculator \- simple desktop calculator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B calculator
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B calculator
starts a desktop calculator with a Tk graphical interface. It supports
addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, power, modulo, square root,
sine, cosine, floor, ceiling and memory keys. Input is possible with the mouse
buttons or from the keyboard.
.SH OPTIONS
The program takes no command-line options.
.SH KEYBOARD
.TP
.B 0\-9 + \- * /
Digits and operators.
.TP
.B Enter
Evaluate the expression.
.TP
.B Backspace
Delete the last character.
.TP
.B Escape
Clear the display.
.SH EXAMPLES
Start the calculator:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ calculator
.fi
.RE
